  "description": "ZIGYOH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H106 Dy5 N8 O28 1+,C2 H3 O2 1-,H2 O1,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.638-3.897 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.03-113.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H135Dy5N8O37.",
